(c) This section contains general definitions and principles of construction and interpretation applicable throughout sections 400.9-103 to 400.9-809 .
(L. 1963 p. 503 § 9-102, A.L. 1988 S.B. 583, A.L. 2001 S.B. 288, A.L. 2002 S.B. 895, A.L. 2013 H.B. 212, A.L. 2014 H.B. 1376)
